temple you enter by walking

3
00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:05.820
down.

4
00:00:06.344 --> 00:00:07.524
A queen's memorial.

5
00:00:07.524 --> 00:00:10.584
Rani ki Vav means the Queen's

6
00:00:10.584 --> 00:00:13.404
Stepwell. UNESCO records that it

7
00:00:13.404 --> 00:00:14.864
was built in the eleventh

8
00:00:14.864 --> 00:00:17.124
century, as a memorial to a

9
00:00:17.124 --> 00:00:17.924
king.

10
00:00:18.372 --> 00:00:20.452
A temple turned upside down.

11
00:00:20.452 --> 00:00:22.552
It was designed as an inverted

12
00:00:22.552 --> 00:00:25.172
